      floor 0.2: Delta_min = 0.125 (viable iff Delta >= Delta_min; below it the logistic host dips under the floor and recovers)
      floor 0.3: Delta_min = 0.192 (viable iff Delta >= Delta_min; below it the logistic host dips under the floor and recovers)
